    card.innerHTML=`${reportProgress('result')}<div class="result-card"><div class="question-kicker">Your free Risk Assessment</div><div class="result-grid"><div class="result-score" style="--scoreAngle:${r.score}%"><span>${r.score}</span></div><div class="result-copy"><div class="status-pill">${r.status} HOME RISK SIGNAL</div><h2>${esc(r.title)}</h2><p>We show the risk first. No email or phone number was required to see this.</p></div></div>${r.breakdown?.length>1?`<div style="background:var(--forest);color:white;border-radius:20px;padding:18px 20px;text-align:left;margin:18px 0"><div class="question-kicker" style="color:#b8cec6">Your system breakdown</div>${breakdown}</div>`:''}<div class="priority-box"><small>Your #1 area to understand</small><h3>${esc(priority)}</h3><p>${esc(r.findings?.[0]?.text||'This is the first area we would investigate based on the information provided.')}</p></div><div class="findings">${renderFindings(r.findings)}</div><div class="result-cta"><div class="question-kicker">Free customized Action Plan</div><h3>Risk tells you what may go wrong. The Action Plan tells you what to do about it.</h3><p>We'll turn this property profile into a prioritized checklist: what to handle now, what can wait, what to do yourself, what may need a professional, and what information to gather before approving work.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" id="planBtn">Build My Free Action Plan →</button><div class="microcopy">We'll ask for your email, then a few details and optional photos so the plan can be specific to this house.</div></div><div class="disclaimer-box">Scores are educational prioritization signals based on the answers and data available to this tool. They do not predict a failure or replace an onsite inspection, diagnosis, engineering opinion, environmental assessment or insurance advice.</div></div>`;
